## Writing Style — ASD-STE100 (Simplified Technical English)

> Optional but recommended for PRs, docs, and decision logs.

- Short sentences (≤20 words procedural, ≤25 words descriptive)
- One instruction per sentence
- Active voice
- Approved words only for verbs/adjectives
- Technical names (API names, tool names, code identifiers) are unchanged — STE does not apply to technical nomenclature
- Reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Technical_English

